! Xft settings for the agent's desktop.
!
! The screen is virtual and read by a model as much as by a person, so this favours
! sharpness over the softening that helps on a physical panel: full hinting rather than
! slight, and no subpixel order — RGB subpixel rendering paints colour fringes that are
! real artefacts in a screenshot, and nothing here is a real LCD anyway.
Xft.dpi:        96
Xft.antialias:  true
Xft.hinting:    true
Xft.hintstyle:  hintfull
Xft.rgba:       none
Xft.lcdfilter:  lcddefault
